{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟日前在 Microsoft Store 上架獨立的中文輸入法，該輸入法由微軟開發且作為獨立輸入法提供。用户下載安裝後會作為新輸入法選項提供，不會直接覆蓋系統內置的微軟拼音輸入法。另外這款輸入法的名稱就叫「中文輸入法」，該輸入法基於 WinUI3 架構開發，因此整體界面與 Windows 11 設計風格更加契合。微軟也強調該輸入法無廣告，不會干擾用户輸入體驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586862.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.193753+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:32:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_hash":"8bf77859d9272e2eb1f2e33bdc0de0c0b661aba094aff3161d54e4f828255a87","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}